// What readReply makes of the bytes read so far. keep says the connection
// can carry another request (ADR 0109 §6): the reply's end was known and
// nothing followed it, and the server didn't ask to close. TooLarge says
// the reply is, or has said it will be, more bytes than readReply's limit
// (ADR 0074 §7a).
enum ReplyRead {
    NeedMore,
    Done(reply: Reply, keep: bool),
    Malformed(reason: string),
    TooLarge,
}
